cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CoachGuard in research or in a product, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "CoachGuard: on-device detection of coached payment scams for Android"
abstract: >-
  An open-source Android SDK that detects authorized push payment (coached payment) scams on the
  device: call, screen-capture and remote-access signals, a per-user behavioral model and an
  explainable risk score, plus an on-device phishing link classifier.
